        "original_id": "20914f58-dcb7-500d-8d56-d2c90ad27979",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Double\n- Products: Blue, Dou3le, \"The Captain of Her Heart\", \"Woman of the World\", \"Rangoon Moon\", \"Devils Ball\"\n- Places: Europe\n- Topics: music releases, hit singles\n\nFacts:\n- Double was a Swiss music duo best known for the hit single \"The Captain of Her Heart\".\n- In 1986, Double released \"The Captain of Her Heart\" as a single, and it became an immediate success throughout Europe.\n- \"The Captain of Her Heart\" was an international smash hit and a plaintive, atmospheric, piano-led ballad.\n- The album Blue included updated versions of Double's earlier singles \"Woman of the World\" and \"Rangoon Moon\".\n- \"Devils Ball\" is a song by Double that was released as the lead single from the duo's second studio album Dou3le.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
